			<dc:description>
				<rdf:Alt>
					<rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Supports e200z446n3. The primary objective of this manual is to describe the functionality of the e200z4 embedded microprocessor core for software and hardware developers. The e200z4 processor family is a set of CPU cores that implement low-cost versions of Power Architecture technology. The e200z4 core is a dual-issue, 32-bit design with 64-bit general-purpose registers (GPRs).</rdf:li>
